# Local-only working guides. These are served publicly if committed (GitHub
# Pages publishes the repo root), so they are kept out of the repo. They stay
# on your disk as internal references.
COMPLIANCE.md
COPY_EN.md
COPY_ES.md
INTAKE_SCREENING.md

# Internal reference material. Never publish: GitHub Pages would serve the
# brandbooks and the consultant's notes as downloadable public files. Kept on
# disk under _private/ so they are easy to find and delete when no longer
# needed. (The leading underscore alone is not protection: a .nojekyll file or
# a change of build would expose it. The ignore rule is what keeps it out.)
_private/

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
